          "title": "You'll want to know: ठोड़ी",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ठोड़ी — ṭhoṛī — \"the chin\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ठोड़ी (ṭhoṛī) is a tadbhava, a word inherited from Sanskrit and reshaped by sound change. It comes from tuṇḍa, \"beak, snout\" (CDIAL 5853). CDIAL calls the word certainly non-Aryan and probably Munda."
            }
          ]
        },
